WEBVTT

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:25.640
Humans reach out to the light,
the flame of hope burning in their hearts.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:30.910
But they're fated to only get so far.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.050
They just don't know it.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:58.360
Their ignorance guides this world
toward destruction,

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.370
yet they don't realize it.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:07.430
They're unaware of this 
tragic cycle that repeats itself

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.100
each time one of them 
is born into this world.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:16.670
I almost pity them.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:17.170
<b>The Sword That Rends Darkness</b>

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.740
How awful.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:37.280
Our research on
the artifact discovered in Maze Pass

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:40.910
revealed that it was engraved 
with a song that can rend evil asunder.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.890
We're going to need your help, Songstress.

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.490
Then everything will be ready.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.860
Ready?

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:49.950
Yeah.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:54.010
We're preparing something incredible 
to take back the Imperial Capital.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.080
Is that...

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.000
Is that an ark?

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.580
A dragon.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.800
Hey!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.180
Aram!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:18.210
As you're aware, our situation 
grows more desperate by the minute.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.950
No matter how many of
the Black Army we defeat,

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:24.160
the fighting will not end
unless we defeat the Black King.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:29.750
The Black Element that engulfed
the Imperial Castle after the last battle

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.960
has formed an even stronger
barrier than before,

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:36.240
preventing us from getting
anywhere near the Black King.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:40.720
Therefore, we must first 
destroy the barrier

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:44.770
with the evil-rending song
engraved on the artifact.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.490
Magnificent!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.660
With this, we can take down the barrier.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.900
Are we going to have Musica 
sing at the barrier?

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:15.730
No, that wouldn't be effective.

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:18.250
The quickest way to take the barrier down...

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.040
...is to destroy it from the inside.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.120
From the inside?

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.130
That's what the Ark is for.

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.970
A great legacy of the Ancients,

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:31.300
the "Ark" can teleport us anywhere instantly.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.900
We'll have the Songstress board it, 
send her directly inside the barrier,

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.270
destroy it from the inside,

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.860
and open a path for
the Suppression Army to strike.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.020
Awesome.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.390
Of course it is.

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:46.380
This Ark is the crowning achievement 
of my magic technology.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:51.040
The once-in-a-lifetime magnum opus
of the Sage of Might.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:56.610
In order to put the Suppression Army within
striking distance of the Imperial Capital,

00:05:56.610 --> 00:06:00.660
we are currently marshaling our
scattered forces at front-line outposts.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:14.430
Also, we will have several people 
board the Ark along with Musica.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.810
Including you, Phoena.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:20.900
We'll need the power of the Chain Chronicle.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:21.580
Yes.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:25.190
Vorg and I, too.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:29.070
Velnar, Yuni, Katya and Clauss 
will also be with us.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.870
Rolo, Kiki, you'll be handling the ship.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.160
That's reassuring.

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:34.900
And Aram...

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.960
You and the guardian dragon
will also go along.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:38.660
Got it.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.230
Are we leaving right away?

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:44.660
No, not yet.

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:50.930
First, we need to restart the dormant Ark
with this initializing magic.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.470
But it's going to take a little longer
to restart it completely.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:57.690
We didn't have much time, after all.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:02.750
It's mostly built using the junk 
that Melchior's been excavating.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.230
You mean important relics.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.860
This is all-out war.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:12.100
Let's show the Black Army that 
the world isn't done for just yet.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.100
Yeah!

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.200
The time has come.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.590
This continent will fall.

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:32.780
Does your conviction waver?

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:36.180
Your former comrades are
about to turn black, into ash.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.190
How does that feel?

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.260
My mind is already made up.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:46.810
I don't care if people turn to dust or ash.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:53.270
If I can't protect them, I might as 
well crush them with my own hands.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.120
Let's begin.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.040
Okay.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.090
There we go.

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:23.230
Sweet. The Hiramekimaru's squeaky clean.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:26.690
Looks like you've gained some 
valuable experience.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.480
I can see it in your sword.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:37.530
I can see how you fought with 
this sword, how you thought,

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.470
and how you've lived your life.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.080
You've made it into a good sword.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.090
Aram.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.270
Thank you.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.260
What's that?

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.440
Aram delivered it to me.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:14.150
We've lost many people we hold dear 
in this long war.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:19.240
But we can't mourn forever.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:26.500
Those of us who have survived must cast
the light of hope upon the people again.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.800
I don't know how long it'll take,

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.200
but we must start by defeating the Black King.

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.720
That's the first step.

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:37.380
We will prevail.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.220
For the future of this land!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.760
Juliana...

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.100
Velnar, you're back.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.940
Yeah, I just returned.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:51.870
You're getting on the Ark, too, aren't you?

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.890
We need to talk.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.220
Come with me.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:03.250
Say, Aram, could you kill Yuri if you had to?

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:10.000
If you can't, then stay off the Ark.

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:13.160
Well?

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.460
I'm going to bring Yuri back.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:18.480
You're dreaming!

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.320
He's not Yuri anymore!

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.310
Velnar.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.940
Remember what you told me before?

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:27.970
That once you look at the whole, you start
to see things you couldn't otherwise?

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:28.850
Yeah.

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:32.990
Maybe I'm not seeing
the big picture at all yet.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:34.940
There's so much I don't know.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:41.190
But I do know what I need to do.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:49.030
All right. Give it your best shot, then.

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:50.230
Velnar!

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.450
I'll figure out the rest.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:53.960
Velnar!

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:55.600
What?

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:57.640
Thanks.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.320
Don't thank me until this is all over.

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:28.410
Phoena?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.280
You're still awake?

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.040
I can't sleep.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.930
Me, neither. I was thinking about some stuff.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:38.770
You're nervous, huh?

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.290
Me?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:43.890
I guess.

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:46.720
Maybe I am.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:54.300
Even though he wouldn't show it, Yuri was 
always nervous before a big fight, too.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.020
Oh?

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:59.320
So this is how Yuri always felt.

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:03.580
Hey, Phoena.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.330
Do you love Yuri?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.000
W-Well, I...

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:31.300
I washed up on Yggdra after my homeland
was destroyed by the Black Army.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:37.070
All I had left was this Chain Chronicle 
my father gave me.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.260
I wandered aimlessly for a while,

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:45.850
but then Yuri took me in. 
He didn't ask any questions.

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:50.830
Ever since then, we traveled together, 
fought together,

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:54.200
laughed together when we had fun,

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:57.590
and cried together when we were sad.

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:05.300
Thanks to Yuri, I felt like I belonged here.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.110
So...

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.730
So to me, Yuri is...

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.310
Same as me, then.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.400
That's why I'm grateful that I met him.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.100
I love the guy, too.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.340
That's not what...

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.810
Did I get it wrong?

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:28.850
N-No, you didn't...

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.350
Phoena.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.080
I'm going to bring Yuri back.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:44.670
I'm going to smack that idiot around 
and make him come to his senses.

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.490
Sounds good.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:50.560
I'll slap him around a bit with you.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.150
What?!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:44.430
Aram!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.870
For my master.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:51.130
Get away from Phoena!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.080
Stay out of my way.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.550
Run, Phoena!

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:57.400
Right!

00:14:58.260 --> 00:14:59.410
You're not going anywhere.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.040
Are you all right?

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.260
Aludra!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:16.220
Get behind me.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:16.930
Okay.

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:19.930
Why are you here?

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.970
I see no need to answer you.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.360
Pay attention!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.290
Let's go.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.400
Crush them!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.800
Damn it! Can't they see I'm busy?

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:55.530
Melchior, will we be able to launch?

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.550
Yeah, I'll have us good to go by sunrise.

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:58.740
We can't wait.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.180
We're setting out immediately.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.580
What?

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:05.810
Our surprise attack is a bust, 
now that they've seen us.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.860
We're going to have to charge in.

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:11.110
I like it.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.070
Can you do it?

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.120
Who do you think I am?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.000
Are you serious?

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.420
Count me in.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.170
Oh, jeez.

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:29.300
Guys, don't let them through here.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.800
We've come under demon attack.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.170
We're going to begin the operation early.

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:38.940
Please take the main force and head 
to the Imperial Capital immediately.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:41.810
All forces, move out.

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:43.310
To the Imperial Capital!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.770
How's the preparation coming?

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.930
Getting there.

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:50.950
All right.

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:53.450
In the meantime,
we'll clear the deck of enemies.

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.400
Where's Musica?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.420
Songstress!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.260
Clauss, can you escort Musica?

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:16.630
I can't.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.720
I have my hands full.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.440
There're too many of them!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:29.190
I told you to stay out of my way.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.030
You're not getting past me!

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:40.870
Melchior, how much longer?

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.370
Almost done.

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:48.190
All right.

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:48.960
We're ready.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.860
We're moving out as soon 
as Musica is on board.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:52.670
Understood.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.130
The Ark!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.350
Hurry.

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:01.580
Prepare for teleportation.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:02.300
Yeah.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.750
The Black Element!

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:19.540
What?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.840
We're losing power.

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:23.070
Can we supplement it?

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:24.460
Not possible.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.720
There's no end to them.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.420
My mana...

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.710
Aludra.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.670
No, you don't!

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.100
Aram!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.740
Use this!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.480
What in the world is this mana?

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.870
With this power, though...

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:10.600
That Aludra sure is something.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.360
It's turning blacker by the second.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.550
Oh, no.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.040
I'm not done yet.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.560
I've got your back!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.900
Prepare to depart.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.260
But it's blackening.

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.310
Leave it to Aram.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:37.810
Aram...

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:43.610
We're almost there!

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:04.210
Go!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:08.850
Start already!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:30.810
Launch!

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:37.370
The Chronicle!

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:41.050
You...

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:56.020
Perfect!

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:27.810
It's the Imperial Castle.

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:29.510
We did it, guys!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.890
I'm counting on you, Furball!

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:41.360
Phoena!

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:49.710
The Chain Chronicle belongs to my master.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:53.150
Phoena!

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Live by the Sword, Die by the Sword</b>

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:48.860
Fate is set in motion.
